  "_comment": [
    "Seed list of company job boards for the Greenhouse and Lever providers.",
    "Unlike a keyword aggregator, an ATS board API has no discovery endpoint:",
    "you must know the company's board token to fetch it. This file is that list.",
    "",
    "'token' is the identifier in the board URL, e.g.",
    "  https://boards.greenhouse.io/<token>   ->  greenhouse token",
    "  https://jobs.lever.co/<token>          ->  lever token",
    "",
    "These entries are CANDIDATES, not verified facts - companies migrate",
    "between ATS vendors and rename their boards. Run:",
    "    python scripts/verify_ats_boards.py --prune",
    "to check every token against the live API and drop the dead ones.",
    "Add your own targets freely; the providers pick up file changes on reload."
  ],

